 "shots": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.5,
   "dur": 2.5,
   "text": "Crispy on the outside, gooey"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 2.5,
   "e": 4.46,
   "dur": 1.96,
   "text": "in the middle."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 4.46,
   "e": 6.42,
   "dur": 1.96,
   "text": "These are the only chocolate chip cookies I make"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 6.42,
   "e": 8.42,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "text": "anymore. And there are three"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 8.42,
   "e": 12.71,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "text": "little things that make them turn out like this every single time. Let's go."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 12.71,
   "e": 18.71,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "Here's everything you need. Butter, brown sugar, white sugar, one egg plus an extra yolk,"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 18.71,
   "e": 23.38,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "text": "vanilla, flour, baking soda, salt, and way too much"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 23.38,
   "e": 28.04,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "text": "chocolate. Full amounts are on screen at the end, so don't write anything down."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 28.04,
   "e": 33.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Rule number one, brown your butter. Melt it on medium and just"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 33.04,
   "e": 38.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "keep swirling. It'll foam up. Then go quiet and"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 38.04,
   "e": 44.04,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "then you'll see little golden brown bits at the bottom. Pull it right there and"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 44.04,
   "e": 49.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "let it cool for 10 minutes so it doesn't scramble the eggs."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 49.04,
   "e": 54.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 54.04,
   "e": 58.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "Both sugars into the butter, mostly brown. That's"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 58.04,
   "e": 63.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "where the chewy comes from. Whisk at a minute till it looks like caramel. Then rule"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 63.04,
   "e": 67.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "number two. One whole egg and one extra yolk."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 67.04,
   "e": 80.04,
   "dur": 13.0,
   "text": "That yolk is the gooey center, vanilla, and whisk till it's glossy and thick. Flour, baking soda, salt, fold,"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 80.04,
   "e": 84.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "don't beat. Just until you can't see dry flour."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 84.04,
   "e": 90.04,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "Overmixing is how you get tough cookies."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 90.04,
   "e": 94.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 94.04,
   "e": 99.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Now the chocolate. Half chips and half a chopped bar."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 99.04,
   "e": 103.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "The chunks melt into puddles. The chips hold their shape."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 103.04,
   "e": 108.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Fold it in."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 108.04,
   "e": 112.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 112.04,
   "e": 117.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Big scoops, like three tablespoons big, and rule number three."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 117.04,
   "e": 122.04,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Chill them. 30 minutes minimum. Cold dough spreads slower."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 122.04,
   "e": 126.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "Edge's crisp, middle stays soft."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 126.04,
   "e": 129.04,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 129.04,
   "e": 133.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "Three 75, 10 to 12 minutes. Watch through the door,"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 133.04,
   "e": 137.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "golden edges, and a middle that still looks a little underdone."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "s": 137.04,
   "e": 144.04,
   "dur": 7.0,
   "text": "out they come, tap the tray once, flaky salt, and now the hardest part. Leave"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "s": 144.04,
   "e": 148.04,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "them alone for five minutes."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "s": 148.04,
   "e": 151.04,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
